  "notes": "A somewhat literary verb expressing deep emotional attachment or admiration.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{慕|した}われる (to be adored by ~)\n- 〜を{慕|した}う (to yearn for ~)\n- {故郷|ふるさと}を{慕|した}う (to long for one's hometown)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used in the passive form {慕|した}われる to describe someone who is loved and respected. The verb conveys warm, respectful affection rather than romantic love.",
